FlintTrade is an independent, native-first trading platform. Its application
code is written from scratch by the FlintTrade authors; it is not a fork or a
derivative of another trading application. FlintTrade can interoperate with
OpenAlgo through an optional bridge adapter, but does not bundle OpenAlgo's
source.

